{"data":[{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-12-24T10:56:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2003781917897035844"],"id":"2003781917897035844","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":9045,"like_count":17,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"今天送外卖收到十块打赏，因为客人以为是男外卖员送餐，开门取餐只穿了内裤，他觉得自己这样很冒犯，于是给了我十块，其实我能看到真的唧唧内心狂喜","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2003781917897035844"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-12-24T07:17:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2003726766272380945"],"id":"2003726766272380945","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8194,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"真的很奇怪！我打扮严实的时候没人看我，当我摘下头套叹叹气每个路过的行人都看我一眼，女生送外卖就这么被歧视？","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2003726766272380945"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-12-23T11:43:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2003431263735284121"],"id":"2003431263735284121","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16759,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":1},"text":"好奇现在人为啥都喜欢让把外卖放门口？出来取会很麻烦嘛？ https://t.co/vfNO4OaAX1","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2003431263735284121"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-12-23T06:19:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2003349796355244207"],"id":"2003349796355244207","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":8082,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"上学那会每天也学不进去，不是上课睡觉就是总想着手冲，辍学打工以后每天累的要死，回家就只想休息，所以我有好长时间没手冲了....","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2003349796355244207"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-12-23T04:20:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2003319670896722263"],"id":"2003319670896722263","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16277,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":1},"text":"送外卖是我唯一的出路，现在回去上学已经晚了... https://t.co/uQSjmysEMB","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2003319670896722263"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-12-22T11:02:52.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2003058650664083554"],"id":"2003058650664083554","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8109,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"忙起来根本没心思手冲，每天送完外卖回家已经精疲力尽，我都快戒色86天了！谁来诱惑我一下，有效果会返图","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2003058650664083554"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-12-22T07:38:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2003007177339048119"],"id":"2003007177339048119","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":15073,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"截止目前，今天的接单量... https://t.co/563FRoqpb6","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2003007177339048119"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-12-22T02:30:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2002929661576376755"],"id":"2002929661576376755","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8449,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":6,"retweet_count":0},"text":"为什么我送外卖，总有人异样的眼光看我？是不是都不太喜欢女外卖员啊？要不是辍学以后没有生活来源了，我也不会送外卖.....","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2002929661576376755"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-12-21T02:40:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2002569783250923733"],"id":"2002569783250923733","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7497,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"text":"最近你们听说了吗？国内经济下滑周杰伦都去美团送外卖了，可见送外卖没啥可丢人的，我送外卖我骄傲～","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/2002569783250923733"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-12-20T15:15:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2002397531129471076"],"id":"2002397531129471076","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":12287,"like_count":13,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我消失了小半年可能没人记得我了，当时说要辍学之后和家长大吵一架