_count":0},"text":"我上小学的时候在回家路上捡到一个U盘，家里刚好有电脑打开文档里面全是那种高清的羞羞照片，具体我现在已经记不清都是些什么画面了，当时小不懂羞羞的事情，看的时候只觉得充满好奇，后来又被我给弄丢了，现在我还不清楚那是私人真实拍的东西还是些片","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1964889066639626587"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-09-06T11:08:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1964284522402332803"],"id":"1964284522402332803","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10807,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"网恋对象说的对，我可能应该辍学去找他的，当一个护士没有前途，免费的实习生还要生一肚子气，我打算不读了","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1964284522402332803"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-09-06T02:09:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1964148833220514010"],"id":"1964148833220514010","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":18639,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"嘟嘟嘟～带上好朋友送我的发夹 https://t.co/7BOzXMlTNh","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1964148833220514010"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-09-05T02:20:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1963789292544962972"],"id":"1963789292544962972","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":17096,"like_count":3,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"谁要第一个偿偿我自制的上等罗非鱼夹海苔?手工做的肯定比外卖卫生 https://t.co/2t4JFFEIOA","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1963789292544962972"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-09-04T13:23:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1963593763550339258"],"id":"1963593763550339258","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":16430,"like_count":3,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"一口半根香蕉隔壁小孩都吓哭了 https://t.co/HR5OZQIXoC","url":"https://x.com/Guillermin45548/status/1963593763550339258"},{"author_id":"1880947070837964800","created_at":"2025-09-04T10:20:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1963547773011464315"],"id":"1963547773011464315","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impre